1
00:00:00,787 --> 00:00:03,612
Running a business means
wearing a lot of hats.

2
00:00:03,612 --> 00:00:08,301
You're looking after customers, answering
the same questions, taking bookings,

3
00:00:08,301 --> 00:00:11,667
and trying to keep your website
up to date, all at once.

4
00:00:12,788 --> 00:00:15,817
Your website should help take
some of that work off your hands.

5
00:00:20,503 --> 00:00:23,198
I'm Marc Teleki, founder of Webescapade.

6
00:00:23,198 --> 00:00:27,241
Drawing on extensive experience
in business and hospitality,

7
00:00:27,241 --> 00:00:33,440
I create practical digital solutions that help
business owners manage their day more easily,

8
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:36,674
serve their customers and
work more efficiently.

9
00:00:37,872 --> 00:00:40,691
Marc knows what a busy
day really feels like.

10
00:00:40,691 --> 00:00:44,575
The phone ringing, a table
waiting, a question about the menu,

11
00:00:44,575 --> 00:00:47,707
and a website still showing
last month's specials.

12
00:00:48,666 --> 00:00:53,323
So every tool we build starts with a
real business need, and one simple aim:

13
00:00:53,323 --> 00:00:57,306
to make your day easier, and your
customers' experience smoother.

14
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:01,772
It starts with your website.

15
00:01:01,772 --> 00:01:04,939
With the Webescapade Site
Builder, you stay in control.

16
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:07,739
Click any words to change them.

17
00:01:07,739 --> 00:01:08,569
Swap a photo.

18
00:01:08,569 --> 00:01:12,911
Update a price, a service or your
opening hours, then press Publish,

19
00:01:12,911 --> 00:01:14,507
and it's live in seconds.

20
00:01:15,772 --> 00:01:16,889
Want a fresh look?

21
00:01:16,889 --> 00:01:20,241
Change the colours across
the whole site in one click,

22
00:01:20,241 --> 00:01:24,028
or let AI write your first draft
from a few simple questions.

23
00:01:25,463 --> 00:01:27,792
Already have a menu or price list?

24
00:01:27,792 --> 00:01:31,970
Drop in the PDF or Word file,
instead of typing it all again.

25
00:01:33,354 --> 00:01:37,882
Every page works beautifully on phones,
so customers can find your menu,

26
00:01:37,882 --> 00:01:40,650
your services or your
phone number in a tap.

27
00:01:41,812 --> 00:01:43,954
Restaurants, salons, tradies, venues:

28
00:01:43,954 --> 00:01:46,965
there's a starting point
for every kind of business.

29
00:01:46,965 --> 00:01:50,729
And if you'd rather not do it
yourself, we'll help you set it up.

30
00:01:59,964 --> 00:02:04,329
For restaurants, Restaurant Deluxe
connects your website with your venue.

31
00:02:04,329 --> 00:02:08,216
Guests book a table directly, or
scan the QR code at their table,

32
00:02:08,216 --> 00:02:12,401
