goes straight to the kitchen screen.

33
00:02:13,464 --> 00:02:16,545
Clearer communication between
your guests and your team,

34
00:02:16,545 --> 00:02:18,307
with fewer trips back and forth.

35
00:02:20,561 --> 00:02:25,446
For salons, spas and clinics, Service
Deluxe lets clients choose a treatment,

36
00:02:25,446 --> 00:02:30,332
their practitioner, and a time that's
genuinely free, at any hour of the day.

37
00:02:31,661 --> 00:02:35,821
Every booking lands in one calendar,
so the whole team stays organised.

38
00:02:39,371 --> 00:02:44,716
For plumbers, electricians and mobile
trades, Trade Deluxe, now in early access,

39
00:02:44,716 --> 00:02:48,523
