44
00:03:03,724 --> 00:03:06,856
so couples and event planners
can explore their date,

45
00:03:06,856 --> 00:03:09,338
and take the next step when they're ready.

46
00:03:10,559 --> 00:03:13,470
From there, they can hold
a date or send an enquiry,

47
00:03:13,470 --> 00:03:16,212
